{%- comment -%}
  LGCY — Animated brand mark. A thin outline traces the shape via
  stroke-dasharray/dashoffset while, in lockstep (same dashoffset progress),
  a wide masking stroke over the real source image reveals its true color/
  gradient — so the color grows in with the line instead of fading in after.
  Plays once per browser session (sessionStorage-gated) and respects
  prefers-reduced-motion; falls back to the static full-color mark otherwise
  (including no-JS).

  Accepts: width, height, css_class, alt
{%- endcomment -%}
